@startuml
!include style.iuml
!pragma teoz true
autonumber
hide footbox
actor Respondent as R
participant "LoginScreen\n(Flutter app)" as App
participant "TokenView\n(API)" as API
participant "Authentication-\nService" as Svc
database "UserRepository\nPostgreSQL" as DB
activate R
R -> App : Email and password
activate App
App -> API : POST /api/v1/\nauth/token/
activate API
API -> Svc : authenticate_user()
activate Svc
Svc -> DB : find_by_email()
activate DB
deactivate DB
alt no account, or wrong password
  Svc --> API : InvalidCredentials
  API --> App : 401 invalid_credentials
  App --> R : "Email or password\nis incorrect."
else suspended or deleted
  Svc --> API : InvalidCredentials
  API --> App : 401 "Account is\nsuspended or deleted."
  App --> R : The message
else email not confirmed
  Svc --> API : EmailNotConfirmed
  API --> App : 403 email_not_\nconfirmed
  App --> R : "Confirm your email\naddress first..."
else all checks pass
  Svc --> API : user
  deactivate Svc
  API -> API : RefreshToken\n.for_user(user)
  activate API
  deactivate API
  API --> App : 200 access (30 min),\nrefresh (7 days)
  deactivate API
  App -> App : TokenStore\nkeeps the pair
  activate App
  deactivate App
  App --> R : Survey list (UC-03)
end
note over App, Svc : Throttle auth_token: 10 a minute, then 429.\nThe password is checked first, so only the\nowner learns the address is unconfirmed.
deactivate App
deactivate R
@enduml
